# Digital Signature System

## Purpose
Court-admissible signature capture for quotation and terms acceptance.

## Dual Sign-Off Required
1. **Quotation Acceptance** - Confirms price and scope
2. **Terms Acceptance** - Confirms T&C agreement

## Audit Record Contents
- Full name (typed)
- Signature image (canvas PNG, base64)
- Timestamp (ISO 8601 UTC)
- IP address (via Worker `/ip`)
- User agent / browser fingerprint
- Document hash (SHA-256)
- Unique signing reference ID

## Storage Locations (R2)
1. Project folder: `NaProjectPortal/{year}-Projects/{code}/10__ProjectAdmin__AppContent/SignatureRecords/`
2. Central archive: `NaProjectPortal/Signatures/{year}/{code}/`

## Module Locations
- `40__SignatureSystem/SignatureSystem__CaptureCanvas__.js` - Canvas drawing
- `40__SignatureSystem/SignatureSystem__AuditRecord__.js` - Audit record generation

## Configuration
Settings in `AppConfiguration__MainAppSettings__.json` under `Features.SignatureSystem`:
- `canvasWidth`, `canvasHeight`
- `strokeColour`, `strokeWidth`
- `requireBothSignatures`
